d-AdvancedDraws tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Advanced Draws</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 3 Midday</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 3 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 3 Night</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 4 Midday</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 4 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 4 Night</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-8\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Georgia Five Midday</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-9\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Georgia Five Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-10\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash Pop Early Bird</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-11\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash Pop Matinee</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-12\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash Pop Drive Time</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-13\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash Pop Primetime</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-14\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash Pop Night Owl</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-15\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Fantasy 5</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-16\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Jumbo Bucks Lotto</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-17\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-18\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-19\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash4Life</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2><br></h2><h2>Georgia Lottery tax Information</h2>\n<p><br></p><p>Georgia Lottery Federal, and state tax withholdings on winnings for U.S. citizens or residents.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-USResidentsTax-no-3\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-USResidentsTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">6.0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">24.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br></p><p>If the winner is not a U.S. citizen or is not a US resident, Georgia Lottery tax withholdings on winnings are as such:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-NonUSTax-no-3\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-NonUSTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $600</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">6.0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $600</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">30.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<figure><br></figure><figure><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Georgia.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" srcset=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Georgia.jpg 894w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Georgia-300x143.jpg 300w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Georgia-768x367.jpg 768w\" alt=\"Georgia lottery\" width=\"800\" height=\"382\"><p></p>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2><br></h2><h2>The Georgia Lottery</h2>\n<p><br></p><p>The Georgia State Lottery was established in November 1992 with the first ticket sales on 29 June 1993. The Lottery in Georgia was launched as a means of funding and supporting local educational initiatives. Over the last 26 years, it’s raked up $80 billion in sales with $22.3 billion going towards the State Treasury's Lottery for Education Account. The funds have assisted more than 2.5 million school children and college students.</p><p><br></p>\n<p>It’s grown from strength to strength, offering players a plethora of games, including Georgia Lottery scratch cards, Georgia Lottery Powerball, and Cash4Life (not to be confused with Georgia Lottery Lucky for Life).&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\n<p>In recent years, it released the Georgia Lottery app that allows players to use the built-in Georgia Lottery ticket scanner. It determines whether your Georgia Lottery numbers are Georgia Lottery winning numbers or scratchers have Georgia Lottery codes.</p><p><br></p>\n<h2>Georgia Lottery FAQ</h2><div><br></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-92a1df7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"27430\" data-id=\"92a1df7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-601a676\" data-eae-slider=\"32900\" data-id=\"601a676\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e07df39 elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"e07df39\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-e07df39\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"e07df39\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"where-to-buy-georgia-lottery-tickets\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2351\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Where to Buy Georgia Lottery Tickets?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2351\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"where-to-buy-georgia-lottery-tickets\"><p>Georgia Lottery tickets can be purchased from authorized retailers to persons 18 years and older.</p><p> </p><p>Georgia Lottery Powerball and Georgia Lottery Mega Millions tickets and others can be purchased online or via the Georgia Lottery app.</p><p> </p><p>You can also use the app to see if you’re one of the Georgia Lottery winners and to view the Georgia Lottery results.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-to-do-if-you-win-the-georgia-state-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2352\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What to Do If You Win the Georgia State Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2352\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"what-to-do-if-you-win-the-georgia-state-lottery\"><p>After viewing the results of the Georgia Lottery, you can claim prizes under $600 at your nearest retailer. Prizes over $600 can be collected at designated offices. Alternatively, winnings can be claimed via mail. Players have up to 180 days to redeem.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-does-the-second-chance-georgia-lottery-work\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2353\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How Does the Second Chance Georgia Lottery Work?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2353\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"how-does-the-second-chance-georgia-lottery-work\"><p>If you weren’t one of the Georgia Lottery winners, you can enter the non-winning ticket into one of the Georgia Lottery second chance promotions.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-cf9e327 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"564\" data-id=\"cf9e327\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6f70c58\" data-eae-slider=\"30328\" data-id=\"6f70c58\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1746139 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1746139\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the Georgia Lottery? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f477aea\" data-eae-slider=\"89728\" data-id=\"f477aea\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fec8d19 elementor-button-success elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"fec8d19\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-